WEBVTT

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:30.989
Um...

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:34.284
5,876 kilmels plus...

00:00:34.284 --> 00:00:37.454
No, this isn't it! I have to add it to <i>this </i>sum!

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:41.291
Calm down. Um... Um...

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:46.338
I don't even have enough basic knowledge, do I?

00:00:46.338 --> 00:00:50.759
The "significance of communicating information
in terms of intermunicipal exchange" is just so...

00:00:50.759 --> 00:00:54.596
I could write any number of reports,
if they weren't about <i>this</i>.

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:03.021
"Wishing you the greatest of luck going forward.

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:07.442
To Leerin Marfes. From Layfon Alseif."

00:01:07.859 --> 00:01:11.488
<i>Since when has he been</i>
<i>able to write things like this?</i>

00:01:12.364 --> 00:01:14.407
Paper sure smells good, huh?

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:19.662
Or could there be a different
scent you're trying to smell, hmm?

00:01:20.830 --> 00:01:21.498
Ow...

00:01:21.498 --> 00:01:23.333
You all right?

00:01:24.376 --> 00:01:25.669
Who are you?!

00:01:25.669 --> 00:01:27.879
You shouldn't go suddenly
frightening people, should you?!

00:01:27.879 --> 00:01:31.049
Sorry 'bout that. But I have business with you.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:32.425
With me?

00:01:32.425 --> 00:01:36.012
I'll say this up front:
this isn't some kind of pick-up attempt.

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:37.764
Why would you say something like that?!

00:01:37.764 --> 00:01:41.601
Well, I thought maybe
that's what you're thinking.

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.436
How overconfident of you.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:48.566
I wonder. I'm often
misunderstood as such, but...

00:01:48.942 --> 00:01:51.152
Wh-What is this?

00:01:55.115 --> 00:01:57.534
We're on... the roof?

00:01:58.952 --> 00:02:03.164
And why did you decide
to use a power technique, hm?

00:02:03.164 --> 00:02:05.542
Because you talk too much.

00:02:05.542 --> 00:02:08.003
Well, this is a delicate matter.

00:02:08.003 --> 00:02:10.964
You're not very discreet, Lintens-<i>san</i>.

00:02:10.964 --> 00:02:12.632
Lintens?

00:02:14.342 --> 00:02:16.261
You're Keepers of the Heaven's Blades...

00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:21.266
Savalis-<i>sama </i>and Lintens-<i>sama</i>... aren't you?

00:02:24.019 --> 00:02:27.022
<i>Brave your truth and brave yourself </i>

00:02:27.022 --> 00:02:30.608
<i>So we can go somewhere with the dite</i>

00:02:30.608 --> 00:02:40.535
<i>Keep hope alive, now we</i>
<i>wanna find the new world</i>

00:02:40.535 --> 00:02:43.913
<i>Roaming around the city having lost my map</i>

00:02:43.913 --> 00:02:47.250
<i>Even a dying world</i>

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:54.090
<i>Let me hear a life deep</i>
<i>within that won't stop running</i>

00:02:54.090 --> 00:02:57.010
<i>I seared the undying light into my eyes</i>

00:02:57.010 --> 00:03:00.555
<i>Refusing to shut them</i>
<i>even when they dried</i>

00:03:00.555 --> 00:03:07.270
<i>I don't believe anything I</i>
<i>can obtain without getting hurt</i>

00:03:07.270 --> 00:03:13.485
<i>A single emotion</i>
<i>directed toward someone</i>

00:03:13.485 --> 00:03:20.742
<i>Splits the steel darkness</i>
<i>like the light of morning</i>

00:03:20.950 --> 00:03:25.372
<i>One day brave your</i>
<i>truth and brave yourself</i>

00:03:25.372 --> 00:03:28.917
<i>So you will drastically change</i>

00:03:28.917 --> 00:03:34.756
<i>Compounded strength and prayers</i>

00:03:34.756 --> 00:03:38.468
<i>Intersecting futures</i>
<i>and wishes held close</i>

00:03:38.468 --> 00:03:42.055
<i>I will give these to no one</i>

00:03:42.055 --> 00:03:43.556
<i>Just tough and alive</i>

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:48.770
<i>It links our hearts</i>

00:03:58.071 --> 00:03:59.531
They're coming.

00:03:59.531 --> 00:04:02.617
One from the front and another from the rear.

00:04:02.617 --> 00:04:03.660
I know.

00:04:03.660 --> 00:04:04.786
Two, huh?

00:04:04.786 --> 00:04:06.996
Ma'am, your orders?

00:04:07.831 --> 00:04:10.709
I'll leave this to you.
Then we go back to the plan.

00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:12.335
Roger.

00:04:12.836 --> 00:04:14.796
Things have gotten rather complicated, eh?

00:04:14.796 --> 00:04:16.339
This is going to be tough.

00:04:16.339 --> 00:04:17.674
So it would appear, but...

00:04:17.674 --> 00:04:18.717
What?

00:04:18.717 --> 00:04:21.052
There are still many cards to play.

00:04:21.594 --> 00:04:24.389
For the 17th Platoon... No,

00:04:25.056 --> 00:04:26.349
for <i>them</i>.

00:04:26.349 --> 00:04:29.936
"A Former Enemy Reduced to a Ruined City"

00:04:30.979 --> 00:04:34.315
And now, it's the man many
call Zuellni's greatest attacker...

00:04:34.315 --> 00:04:37.736
Gorneo Lueckens has appeared!

00:04:38.987 --> 00:04:40.363
Lueckens.

00:04:40.363 --> 00:04:44.993
Oh! Lueckens is from Glendan,
the same as Layfon.

00:04:44.993 --> 00:04:46.327
Yes.

00:04:46.327 --> 00:04:48.371
What's more, he's the younger brother of

00:04:48.371 --> 00:04:51.124
Savalis Lueckens,
a Keeper of the Heaven's Blade.

00:04:51.124 --> 00:04:52.709
It would seem almost like fate, no?

00:04:52.709 --> 00:04:53.877
You...!

00:04:53.877 --> 00:04:58.298
You can run and run, but the past will always
catch up...

00:04:58.298 --> 00:04:59.299
Layfon.

00:04:59.799 --> 00:05:03.428
Tempered Transformation,
Hardened Spear Strike!

00:05:11.102 --> 00:05:13.855
I'm not through yet!

00:05:25.367 --> 00:05:26.993
What?!

00:05:32.582 --> 00:05:34.334
He completely repelled my attack?!

00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:36.753
Leave him to me!

00:05:38.338 --> 00:05:39.756
Shante! What are you...?!

00:05:39.756 --> 00:05:42.759
Fire Kei, Great Projectile Flash!

00:05:57.816 --> 00:06:00.276
Damn! I thought that would work!

00:06:00.276 --> 00:06:02.278
Why aren't you protecting the flag?

00:06:02.278 --> 00:06:05.532
If we get rid of him,
the 17th Platoon will be no sweat!

00:06:05.532 --> 00:06:07.617
Don't be stupid! This is a competi--

00:06:07.617 --> 00:06:09.452
He's here!

00:06:21.297 --> 00:06:22.674
The Thousand-Man Attack.

00:06:22.674 --> 00:06:25.635
To think he's even mastered <i>this </i>technique...

00:06:26.094 --> 00:06:29.180
Shante! Let's do it.

00:06:36.104 --> 00:06:37.063
Found him!

00:06:37.063 --> 00:06:38.690
Prepare yours--

00:06:45.947 --> 00:06:51.578
Whoa! And victory has been
decided. The 17th Platoon wins!

00:06:51.578 --> 00:06:53.788
That was excellent Tempered Kei.

00:06:53.788 --> 00:06:57.667
I never thought a Lueckens
would be <i>here</i>, in this place.

00:06:57.667 --> 00:07:01.796
You think saying that
will get a handshake from me?

00:07:01.796 --> 00:07:03.423
No, I don't.

00:07:03.423 --> 00:07:05.050
Hup!

00:07:09.304 --> 00:07:10.347
Wait!

00:07:10.347 --> 00:07:13.475
I'll remember this!
You're going <i>down</i>, Mister! You're--!

00:07:13.475 --> 00:07:15.101
Shante.

00:07:15.685 --> 00:07:17.687
Let go, Gorneo!

00:07:17.687 --> 00:07:20.648
You! You're Gor's enemy!

00:07:21.399 --> 00:07:24.027
We did it, Layfon.

00:07:28.698 --> 00:07:34.871
Now then! To celebrate
the 17th Platoon's second straight win...

00:07:34.871 --> 00:07:37.832
I'll be singing one more song!

00:07:40.460 --> 00:07:45.131
♪ Hello, who are you thinking of... ♪

00:07:45.131 --> 00:07:46.883
Why don't you sing next?

00:07:46.883 --> 00:07:49.761
If you let her, that girl
will never let go of the mic.

00:07:49.761 --> 00:07:51.429
No can do.

00:07:51.429 --> 00:07:55.517
My songs aren't for the crowd to listen to.

00:07:55.517 --> 00:07:58.937
Oh goodness! Then when do you sing?

00:07:59.312 --> 00:08:02.023
When I'm alone with a special someone.

00:08:02.023 --> 00:08:05.944
Mmm, and who would
that special someone be tonight?

00:08:05.944 --> 00:08:08.113
Uh, aggressive much?

00:08:08.113 --> 00:08:09.989
Sharnid. You did great out there, too.

00:08:09.989 --> 00:08:10.907
Ma'am.

00:08:10.907 --> 00:08:14.077
How was it, fighting out
in front for the first time in a while?

00:08:14.077 --> 00:08:19.374
No biggie. Still, I enjoyed
the other guys' freaking out

00:08:19.374 --> 00:08:22.502
when they realized I could use <i>jusho-jutsu</i>.

00:08:22.502 --> 00:08:25.672
Having mastered both distance
attacks and close-range combat

00:08:25.672 --> 00:08:27.382
is of great benefit to the platoon.

00:08:27.382 --> 00:08:30.760
Between you and Layfon,
it will increase our possible strategies.

00:08:30.760 --> 00:08:32.846
Our unit will get stronger and stronger.

00:08:32.846 --> 00:08:35.473
So you're saying that I'm the bomb?

00:08:35.473 --> 00:08:39.269
Ah, well... Let's have it mean that for today.

00:08:39.686 --> 00:08:42.522
You shouldn't let him get too carried away.

00:08:42.522 --> 00:08:44.691
Yes, I know. This is just for today.

00:08:44.691 --> 00:08:45.734
How cruel!

00:08:45.734 --> 00:08:47.027
Here, Nina. You like this, right?

00:08:47.027 --> 00:08:49.863
Yeah. Thank you.

00:08:49.863 --> 00:08:51.072
Maybe I'll have some, too...

00:08:51.072 --> 00:08:53.033
Go get your own, please.

00:08:53.033 --> 00:08:54.659
The hell?!

00:08:57.245 --> 00:08:58.955
Come on, hurry up and do it.

00:08:58.955 --> 00:09:00.999
No, not today.

00:09:00.999 --> 00:09:05.211
What are you saying? If you
don't give it to him today, when will you?

00:09:06.296 --> 00:09:07.630
Layfon...

00:09:07.922 --> 00:09:09.966
What's up with him?

00:09:17.724 --> 00:09:21.936
<i>I want to feel the world. This world...</i>

00:09:21.936 --> 00:09:25.523
<i>and beyond the vast darkness.</i>

00:09:28.777 --> 00:09:31.529
But Gor, he's your enemy, right?

00:09:32.280 --> 00:09:35.867
Even so, you can't just
throw away a competition.

00:09:35.867 --> 00:09:39.954
But it was the perfect chance.
If we wait for the next one...

00:09:39.954 --> 00:09:41.289
Don't you worry.

00:09:41.289 --> 00:09:44.918
No matter how much time
passes, this anger will not fade!

00:09:44.918 --> 00:09:46.294
Gor...

00:09:46.294 --> 00:09:47.921
Layfon Alseif...

00:09:48.797 --> 00:09:52.217
I'll make sure you pay for your crime!

00:09:53.718 --> 00:09:55.303
You!

00:09:55.303 --> 00:09:57.389
What are you doing here?

00:09:57.389 --> 00:10:00.433
I have no reason to speak to either of you.

00:10:00.433 --> 00:10:01.434
Ha!

00:10:01.476 --> 00:10:04.813
That's the 17th for you, the guys
who'd let a <i>coward </i>into their ranks!

00:10:04.813 --> 00:10:06.815
Your unit is rotten to the core!

00:10:06.815 --> 00:10:07.941
Coward?

00:10:07.941 --> 00:10:08.858
What?

00:10:08.858 --> 00:10:10.110
You don't even know?!

00:10:10.110 --> 00:10:11.736
Shante!

00:10:20.495 --> 00:10:22.122
I am not pleased.

00:10:45.186 --> 00:10:48.106
So, Biggie's in one of those?

00:10:48.106 --> 00:10:50.025
Time's runnin' out.

00:10:55.113 --> 00:10:56.364
Ma'am!

00:10:56.364 --> 00:10:57.073
Yeah.

00:10:57.073 --> 00:10:58.366
You're early, aren't you?

00:10:58.366 --> 00:11:02.412
I thought I'd see Zuellni for a bit,
but she won't show herself.

00:11:02.412 --> 00:11:04.080
Oh.

00:11:04.080 --> 00:11:07.500
Say, when we're done,
can you spare a few minutes?

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:10.170
I thought up a strategy
for the next competition.

00:11:10.170 --> 00:11:13.006
I'd like to hear your opinion.

00:11:13.631 --> 00:11:14.674
Is something the matter?

00:11:14.674 --> 00:11:18.178
It's just, you look like you're enjoying this.

00:11:18.178 --> 00:11:21.222
Like you're impatient, wanting to fight.

00:11:22.057 --> 00:11:23.892
That's not...

00:11:25.393 --> 00:11:29.981
Well, yeah. Truth be told,
I might be feeling that.

00:11:29.981 --> 00:11:35.904
I'm happy. Our unit
is growing, racking up victories.

00:11:37.155 --> 00:11:39.324
I think it was about two years ago...

00:11:39.324 --> 00:11:41.409
There was an intermunicipal battle.

00:11:41.409 --> 00:11:43.370
The battle would decide ownership

00:11:43.370 --> 00:11:46.706
of a sernium mine, the Regios's energy.

00:11:46.706 --> 00:11:50.043
It was an important fight,
one of municipal life or death.

00:11:50.043 --> 00:11:55.298
During that battle, I was unable
to help my comrades, and we lost.

00:11:56.091 --> 00:11:58.885
Back then, the platoon members of the rival city

00:11:58.885 --> 00:12:02.430
hugged one another, happy,
and seeing that I thought...

00:12:02.430 --> 00:12:05.350
One day, I want to stand with comrades

00:12:05.350 --> 00:12:07.435
and protect our city by our own hands...

00:12:07.435 --> 00:12:11.189
to be victorious and to share our happiness.

00:12:11.523 --> 00:12:15.318
Now, bit by bit, that dream is coming true.

00:12:16.569 --> 00:12:21.199
I can feel it...
the potential of the 17th Platoon.

00:12:21.199 --> 00:12:23.535
That's why you say you're happy?

00:12:23.535 --> 00:12:25.161
Yeah.

00:12:27.122 --> 00:12:32.293
I've never once been happy about fighting...

00:12:32.293 --> 00:12:35.755
no matter what kind of victory was the result.

00:12:35.755 --> 00:12:39.259
Because in this world, it has no real meaning.

00:12:39.259 --> 00:12:40.510
No meaning?

00:12:40.510 --> 00:12:42.554
So this is where you are?

00:12:42.554 --> 00:12:44.514
The student council president's calling you.

00:12:44.514 --> 00:12:47.350
The student council president?

00:12:49.310 --> 00:12:51.146
Pardon the intrusion.

00:12:56.359 --> 00:13:00.030
You know why you've
been called here, do you not?

00:13:00.030 --> 00:13:01.239
No, not again!

00:13:01.239 --> 00:13:04.701
The contaminoids? Unfortunately, no.

00:13:04.701 --> 00:13:08.121
But in a sense, this is even more troublesome.

00:13:08.121 --> 00:13:09.956
What's this?!

00:13:22.010 --> 00:13:24.596
<i>I'm being targeted? Me?</i>

00:13:24.596 --> 00:13:28.058
<i>Yes. I'm terribly sorry, but just in case,</i>

00:13:28.058 --> 00:13:30.769
<i>we'll have to provide</i>
<i>you with covert protection.</i>

00:13:30.769 --> 00:13:33.772
<i>But targeted by whom? And why?</i>

00:13:33.772 --> 00:13:37.025
<i>I believe we said, "No questions."</i>

00:13:39.027 --> 00:13:41.738
This does weigh on one's mind...

00:13:43.823 --> 00:13:45.784
Sure enough, these are the best! <i>These</i>!

00:13:45.784 --> 00:13:48.411
This is the chest to come back for!

00:13:48.411 --> 00:13:50.372
This is where my home lies!

00:13:50.372 --> 00:13:52.957
Shi-Shinora-<i>san</i>...

00:13:52.957 --> 00:13:55.585
Your chest gets 1,000,000 points!

00:13:55.585 --> 00:13:56.920
Shinora-<i>san</i>!

00:13:56.920 --> 00:13:59.589
Please don't assign points to a person's chest!

00:13:59.589 --> 00:14:02.592
This is hardly the time for that now...

00:14:04.344 --> 00:14:06.721
Hm. You don't say.

00:14:06.721 --> 00:14:12.435
It's reassuring having two
Heaven's Blades protecting me, but...

00:14:12.435 --> 00:14:14.479
I'm still worried.

00:14:14.479 --> 00:14:17.565
But they said "Just in case," right?

00:14:17.565 --> 00:14:19.401
Yes, but...

00:14:22.404 --> 00:14:26.825
I'm sorry, but this has to do with Layfon.

00:14:33.915 --> 00:14:36.835
It'll be scary if I'm out late,
so I'm going home!

00:14:36.835 --> 00:14:38.169
Well, be careful.

00:14:38.169 --> 00:14:40.296
Okay. Well, bye.

00:14:44.050 --> 00:14:45.093
Savalis.

00:14:45.093 --> 00:14:47.220
Yes, Your Majesty?

00:14:47.220 --> 00:14:50.098
You're forbidden from calling me that here.

00:14:50.098 --> 00:14:54.060
Oops! It was a mistake, Alshera-<i>sama</i>.

00:14:54.060 --> 00:14:57.981
My apologies.
That is also forbidden, Shinora-<i>san</i>.

00:14:59.190 --> 00:15:00.984
You're an annoying man.

00:15:00.984 --> 00:15:02.777
The 8th Gate is now on standby.

00:15:02.777 --> 00:15:05.113
Please complete landroller inspections ASAP.

00:15:05.113 --> 00:15:06.573
The current temperature is 13 degrees,

00:15:06.573 --> 00:15:07.282
--with hazardous substances
--A city attacked by the contaminoids?

00:15:07.282 --> 00:15:08.992
--comprising 58% of the atmosphere.
--A city attacked by the contaminoids?

00:15:08.992 --> 00:15:11.119
--There are no obstacles to driving.
--It's in Zuellni's travel path,

00:15:11.119 --> 00:15:13.204
and it's stopped moving.

00:15:13.204 --> 00:15:16.249
Barring any changes,
we'll reach it in three days.

00:15:17.751 --> 00:15:21.463
Go ahead, see if it's safe, then come back, huh?

00:15:21.463 --> 00:15:23.798
Good luck with that.

00:15:23.798 --> 00:15:26.676
You're coming, too!
Hurry up and get changed, idiot!

00:15:26.676 --> 00:15:27.886
Ma'aaam.

00:15:27.886 --> 00:15:29.637
If we weren't in such a rush,

00:15:29.637 --> 00:15:32.349
I could've given you the new adamandite.

00:15:32.349 --> 00:15:33.767
New?

00:15:33.767 --> 00:15:35.852
I guess you could say it's antipersonnel.

00:15:35.852 --> 00:15:37.312
It's lighter,

00:15:37.312 --> 00:15:40.065
but as a result,
you can't trade out different dites.

00:15:40.565 --> 00:15:43.026
I think it's almost ready for use...

00:15:43.026 --> 00:15:44.778
Anyway, I'll tell you when it's done.

00:15:44.778 --> 00:15:46.613
Fon-Fon?

00:15:48.782 --> 00:15:50.075
What is it, ma'a--

00:15:50.075 --> 00:15:51.826
Ow! Uh, Felli!

00:15:51.826 --> 00:15:55.413
Why are we going with the 5th Platoon?

00:15:55.413 --> 00:15:56.664
According to the student council president,

00:15:56.664 --> 00:15:59.584
none of the other platoons have enough suits.

00:15:59.584 --> 00:16:02.796
How transparent. He enrages me.

00:16:02.796 --> 00:16:04.881
The 5th Platoon's vehicles will now move out.

00:16:04.881 --> 00:16:07.300
Please clear the No. 3 laneway ASAP.

00:16:17.644 --> 00:16:19.270
Monkey.

00:16:19.604 --> 00:16:22.607
Well, shall we move out, ma'am?

00:16:22.607 --> 00:16:27.445
Sharnid... Sorry, but would you go with Felli?

00:16:27.445 --> 00:16:29.656
Yeah, I guess.

00:16:34.077 --> 00:16:35.161
Say, Gor?

00:16:35.161 --> 00:16:36.079
What?

00:16:36.079 --> 00:16:39.040
Can't we settle it here,
make it look like an accident?

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:42.711
It's not that easy.
You saw how powerful he is, didn't you?

00:16:42.711 --> 00:16:46.256
Yeah, but still! We could take him by surprise!

00:16:46.256 --> 00:16:48.216
If you think you could defeat him like that,

00:16:48.216 --> 00:16:53.054
you've got a long way to go.
He's a former Heaven's Blade.

00:16:53.054 --> 00:16:58.810
Yeah, well so what?
I think you're a lot stronger than him.

00:17:08.111 --> 00:17:10.655
I thought I'd come to
understand a little, but...

00:17:10.655 --> 00:17:11.364
I'm sorry?

00:17:11.364 --> 00:17:12.782
About <i>you</i>.

00:17:12.782 --> 00:17:14.492
That came out of nowhere.

00:17:14.492 --> 00:17:16.870
"Winning has no real meaning."

00:17:16.870 --> 00:17:19.164
I can't get over what you said yesterday.

00:17:19.164 --> 00:17:21.166
Please don't give it too much thought.

00:17:21.166 --> 00:17:23.752
I just said what I was thinking.

00:17:23.752 --> 00:17:26.379
But you meant it, right?

00:17:26.379 --> 00:17:29.549
Winning a competition means
gaining strength and confidence.

00:17:29.549 --> 00:17:32.052
Winning an intermunicipal
battle means getting a sernium mine,

00:17:32.052 --> 00:17:36.556
the Regios's energy source.
Does that mean nothing, too?

00:17:36.556 --> 00:17:38.850
I see it. It's coming up to the west.

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:39.517
Layfon!

00:17:39.517 --> 00:17:42.270
Let's talk about this later.

00:17:52.864 --> 00:17:56.284
Looks like the outer gate's
out of whack. It's wires or nothing.

00:17:56.284 --> 00:17:57.827
Wait. First...

00:17:57.827 --> 00:18:00.205
Felli! Can you tell how things are in there?

00:18:00.205 --> 00:18:02.248
I get only fragments, but...

00:18:02.248 --> 00:18:04.876
Currently, there is no danger.

00:18:04.876 --> 00:18:09.714
This is the 5th Platoon.
We've finished our search around the east gate.

00:18:09.714 --> 00:18:10.840
How's it look?

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:13.051
The dock is completely destroyed.

00:18:13.051 --> 00:18:15.345
We've got five people,
including our platoon leader,

00:18:15.345 --> 00:18:17.472
trying to enter via a damaged external section.

00:18:17.472 --> 00:18:19.224
Can you get in, Layfon?

00:18:19.224 --> 00:18:21.976
Yes. Restoration-02.

00:18:24.813 --> 00:18:26.648
Please take me as well.

00:18:26.648 --> 00:18:28.274
Roger.

00:18:29.401 --> 00:18:31.236
Here we go.

00:18:33.947 --> 00:18:35.532
We go in next.

00:18:35.532 --> 00:18:38.576
Roger that!

00:18:38.576 --> 00:18:40.370
You don't have to do that.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:43.581
I can guarantee this place's safety, Fon-Fon.

00:18:43.581 --> 00:18:48.128
It's sort of a habit.
You have to make sure for yourself, right?

00:18:48.128 --> 00:18:52.549
It is unnecessary. If you are going
to expend energy unnecessarily...

00:18:53.383 --> 00:18:56.094
please try to be more polite about it.

00:18:56.094 --> 00:18:57.178
I'm sorry.

00:18:57.178 --> 00:18:58.596
How is it?

00:18:58.596 --> 00:19:00.056
There's no bioactivity.

00:19:00.056 --> 00:19:01.433
How's the air filter?

00:19:01.433 --> 00:19:03.852
Functioning normally.

00:19:04.894 --> 00:19:06.896
I guarantee it.

00:19:17.115 --> 00:19:21.703
Niiice. A ghost town, huh?

00:19:23.955 --> 00:19:27.709
No doubt about it,
they were attacked by contaminoids.

00:19:27.709 --> 00:19:29.336
Yeah...

00:19:29.336 --> 00:19:31.171
Let's confirm if there are any survivors.

00:19:31.171 --> 00:19:32.422
Yes, Ma'am.

00:19:32.422 --> 00:19:35.175
No need to get our hopes up though, huh?

00:19:35.175 --> 00:19:38.053
If they were to seek shelter,
what about the plaza up ahead?

00:19:38.053 --> 00:19:40.263
Good. Let's hurry!

00:19:42.015 --> 00:19:42.891
It's terrible.

00:19:42.891 --> 00:19:45.310
The monument's completely destroyed.

00:19:46.311 --> 00:19:47.812
This is...

00:19:47.812 --> 00:19:49.439
Ma'am?

00:19:52.442 --> 00:19:55.236
Do you know this place?

00:19:55.236 --> 00:19:58.782
It's Gandweria...
The city we fought two years ago.

00:19:58.782 --> 00:20:03.828
Yeah, now I remember!
Sure enough, it's Gandweria, the city we fought.

00:20:03.828 --> 00:20:05.538
But why...?

00:20:05.538 --> 00:20:09.167
I wonder how long it's been
since the contaminoids attacked.

00:20:09.167 --> 00:20:12.587
Maybe they got hit
right after they beat Zuellni.

00:20:12.587 --> 00:20:15.632
Two years...
Just two years!

00:20:15.632 --> 00:20:19.594
This city beat Zuellni
and should've had plenty of mines!

00:20:19.594 --> 00:20:22.347
The city had adequate
fighting strength and a tight-knit--

00:20:22.347 --> 00:20:24.557
That means nothing!

00:20:25.100 --> 00:20:26.893
Not to the contaminoids.

00:20:26.893 --> 00:20:28.520
Layfon...

00:20:29.437 --> 00:20:30.897
They don’t care whether you
win the intermunicipal battle...

00:20:30.897 --> 00:20:33.191
Or how many mines you have...

00:20:33.191 --> 00:20:35.819
Or how strong you become.

00:20:36.611 --> 00:20:38.238
Ma'am!

00:21:15.400 --> 00:21:17.027
I...

00:21:21.281 --> 00:21:23.033
Can I ask you something?

00:21:23.033 --> 00:21:24.200
What is it?

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:27.412
What is victory for you?

00:21:28.663 --> 00:21:31.207
Having survived the present.

00:21:32.042 --> 00:21:35.295
Myself and those I want to protect...

00:21:35.295 --> 00:21:38.715
All of us having survived, letting no one die.

00:21:43.178 --> 00:21:45.013
Look out!

00:21:58.234 --> 00:22:03.907
That's how you've fought your way,
knowing not the pride of the military artist?

00:22:03.907 --> 00:22:06.326
How you sullied the name of the
Heaven's Blades and were expelled

00:22:06.326 --> 00:22:10.080
yet live complacently, as if it meant nothing?

00:22:10.080 --> 00:22:12.082
Heaven's Blades?

00:22:35.313 --> 00:22:38.066
<i>Beyond memory</i>

00:22:38.066 --> 00:22:46.491
<i>A map of the ideal future</i>
<i>you'd been searching for</i>

00:22:46.491 --> 00:22:57.544
<i>Scared of something, not</i>
<i>understanding, trembling alone</i>

00:22:57.544 --> 00:23:08.847
<i>Unable to see you, I'm</i>
<i>always wearing a fake smile</i>

00:23:08.847 --> 00:23:18.064
<i>I was held in your arms</i>

00:23:18.064 --> 00:23:23.695
<i>Fall in love like</i>
<i>you're waking up</i>

00:23:23.695 --> 00:23:29.075
<i>And then take</i>
<i>me into dreamland</i>

00:23:29.075 --> 00:23:34.831
<i>You always, you always</i>

00:23:34.831 --> 00:23:44.966
<i>You always told me tender lies</i>

00:23:53.767 --> 00:23:55.185
<i>In the midst of their joint expedition,</i>

00:23:55.185 --> 00:23:58.396
<i>Gorneo tells Nina of Layfon's past crime,</i>

00:23:58.396 --> 00:24:01.358
<i>while in Glendan, Leerin, who is being targeted,</i>

00:24:01.358 --> 00:24:04.736
<i>receives protection from</i>
<i>Heaven's Blades Savalis and Lintens.</i>

00:24:04.736 --> 00:24:06.696
<i>Next time,</i>
<i>"The Right to be a Heaven's Blade," and..</i>.

00:24:06.696 --> 00:24:08.086
<i>Restoration!</i>
